<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept service price index down 0.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept service price index down 0.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) in September fell 0.8 percent from a year earlier to 101.9, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year (Y-Y) and month-on-month (M-M):</p>
<p>			     Y-Y   M-M</p>
<p> Overall		   -0.8  -0.1</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance     -0.1   0.0</p>
<p> Real estate	     -2.1  -0.1</p>
<p> Transport		  0.0  -0.6</p>
<p> Information services  -0.1   0.0</p>
<p> Communications	  -1.8   0.0</p>
<p> Advertising services  +1.3  +1.5  Lease/rental services -5.5  -0.7  Other services	  +0.4  +0.1</p>
</text>
